Product logos

Every logo in this directory is the trademark of the project or company it
belongs to, and is used only to name that product where it is offered.

Most files come from homarr-labs/dashboard-icons
(https://github.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0 — see LICENSE in this directory. Some are renamed after the
product they are used for (seerr.svg is the collection's jellyseerr.svg), the
raster ones — docker-compose.webp among them — were resized to 96px WebP, and
gotify.svg had an empty Illustrator extension element removed.

jupyter.svg is from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), CC0 1.0.

mysql.svg is devicon's mysql-original.svg (https://github.com/devicons/devicon),
recoloured from #00618A to #57afe0 so it reads on a dark ground; sqlite.svg is
devicon's sqlite-original.svg and sqlserver.svg its microsoftsqlserver-plain.svg,
both unchanged. All three are used under the MIT License:

